<section class="section operator-section">
    <div class="section-wrap operator-grid">
        <div class="phone-wrap reveal">
            <div class="phone">
                <div class="phone-screen operator-phone-screen phone-screenshot-screen">
                    {% set operatorScreenshots = [
                        'fuelpass/images/operator-app-1.jpg',
                        'fuelpass/images/operator-app-2.jpg',
                        'fuelpass/images/operator-app-3.jpg',
                        'fuelpass/images/operator-app-4.jpg',
                        'fuelpass/images/operator-app-5.jpg',
                        'fuelpass/images/operator-app-6.jpg'
                    ] %}
                    <div class="phone-slider screenshot-slider" data-phone-slider>
                        {% for operatorScreenshot in operatorScreenshots %}
                            <div class="phone-slide {{ loop.first ? 'is-active' }}">
                                <img class="phone-screenshot" src="{{ asset(operatorScreenshot) }}" alt="FuelPass operator app screenshot {{ loop.index }}">
                            </div>
                        {% endfor %}
                    </div>
                    <div class="phone-dots screenshot-dots" data-phone-dots aria-label="Operator app screenshots">
                        {% for operatorScreenshot in operatorScreenshots %}
                            <button class="{{ loop.first ? 'is-active' }}" type="button" aria-label="Show screenshot {{ loop.index }}"></button>
                        {% endfor %}
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="app-panel reveal" data-delay="1">
            <div class="app-panel-head">
                <span>Operator app</span>
                <strong>A second app, purpose-built for the pump.</strong>
            </div>
            <p class="operator-lead">Station attendants run FuelPass on a rugged Android or iOS device — scan a citizen's QR, dispense the requested volume, and the central ledger updates instantly. Works without signal.</p>
            <div class="app-bullets">
                <article><span aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 8V5a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h3M16 4h3a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3M20 16v3a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-3M8 20H5a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-3"/><path d="M8 8h3v3H8zM13 8h3v3h-3zM8 13h3v3H8zM13 13h3v3h-3z"/></svg></span><div><h3>Scan-to-dispense in 2 seconds</h3><p>Open the camera, point at the QR, confirm the volume. No paperwork, no manual entry, no disputes.</p></div></article>
                <article><span aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 7h10M7 12h10M7 17h6"/><path d="M4 6.5c.8-.7 1.7-.7 2.5 0s1.7.7 2.5 0M15 17.5c.8-.7 1.7-.7 2.5 0s1.7.7 2.5 0"/></svg></span><div><h3>Offline-first ledger</h3><p>Up to 500 transactions buffered locally and reconciled when the device reconnects to the network.</p></div></article>
                <article><span aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 19V5M19 19H5"/><path d="M8 16v-5M12 16V8M16 16v-8"/></svg></span><div><h3>Live shift dashboard</h3><p>Track litres dispensed, queue load and end-of-shift cash reconciliation, all in one place.</p></div></article>
                <article><span aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3 19 7v5c0 4.2-2.8 7.1-7 9-4.2-1.9-7-4.8-7-9V7l7-4Z"/><path d="m9.5 12 1.7 1.7L15 10"/></svg></span><div><h3>Tamper-evident audit trail</h3><p>Every dispense is cryptographically signed by the device. Stations and inspectors can verify any record.</p></div></article>
            </div>
            <div class="store-row">
                <a href="#" class="store-badge store-badge-apple" aria-label="Download on the App Store">
                    <span aria-hidden="true">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 26 32" fill="currentColor"><path d="M17.7 16.7c0-3.2 2.6-4.7 2.7-4.8-1.5-2.2-3.8-2.5-4.6-2.5-1.9-.2-3.8 1.1-4.8 1.1-1 0-2.5-1.1-4.1-1.1-2.1 0-4 1.2-5.1 3.1-2.2 3.8-.6 9.4 1.6 12.5 1 1.5 2.3 3.2 4 3.1 1.6-.1 2.2-1 4.1-1s2.5 1 4.2 1c1.7 0 2.8-1.5 3.9-3 1.2-1.7 1.7-3.4 1.7-3.5-.1 0-3.6-1.3-3.6-4.9Zm-3.1-9c.9-1.1 1.4-2.6 1.3-4.1-1.3.1-2.8.8-3.7 1.9-.8 1-1.5 2.5-1.3 4 1.4.1 2.8-.7 3.7-1.8Z"/></svg>
                    </span>
                    <small>Download on the</small>
                    <strong>App Store</strong>
                </a>
                <a href="#" class="store-badge store-badge-google" aria-label="Get it on Google Play">
                    <span aria-hidden="true">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 26 30"><path d="M2 1.5C1.6 1.9 1.4 2.5 1.4 3.3v23.4c0 .8.2 1.4.6 1.8l.1.1L15 15.1v-.3L2 1.5Z" fill="#5bc9f4"/><path d="m19.2 19.4-4.2-4.3v-.3l4.2-4.3.1.1 5 2.8c1.4.8 1.4 2.1 0 2.9l-5 2.9-.1.2Z" fill="#fee000"/><path d="M19.3 19.3 14.9 15 2 28c.5.5 1.3.5 2.2.1l15.1-8.8Z" fill="#ea4335"/><path d="M19.3 10.7 4.2 2C3.3 1.5 2.5 1.5 2 2l13 13 4.3-4.3Z" fill="#34a853"/></svg>
                    </span>
                    <small>Get it on</small>
                    <strong>Google Play</strong>
                </a>
            </div>
            <div class="qr-install operator-install">
                <div class="qr-code-placeholder" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none">
                        <path d="M6 6h13v13H6zM29 6h13v13H29zM6 29h13v13H6z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/>
                        <path d="M11 11h3v3h-3zM34 11h3v3h-3zM11 34h3v3h-3zM25 25h5v5h-5zM34 25h8v4h-8zM25 35h4v7h-4zM34 34h3v3h-3zM39 39h3v3h-3z" fill="currentColor"/>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <strong>Scan to install operator app</strong>
                    <p>Use the operator-issued device. Activation requires your station code.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="app-note operator-note">
                <span aria-hidden="true">▣</span>
                <p>For licensed station operators only. Issued by the Ministry of Energy after KYC.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
